<<has entity=`band` name=`foreign` params=`exit/3 fields/[[radius refused rows exit]] ~ a foreign target refused; --force takes it`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`unreachable` params=`exit/4 fields/[[radius rows exit]] ~ a store write failed`>>
```

